\section{PHASE SHIFT OF RADIATION RADIATED BY A PARTICLE (BUNCH)}
Consider the particle speed given by
\begin{equation}\label{totv1}
{\bf v} = \kappa c\, {\hat b}_{\rm 0t}+{\bf v}_{\rm rot}.
\end{equation}
By substituting for ${\bf v}_{\rm rot}$ (eq. 3 in G04b) into equation~(\ref{totv1})
we achieve
\begin{equation}\label{totv}
{\bf v} = (\kappa c+\Omega r \sin\theta'\cos\Theta) \, {\hat b}_{\rm 0t}+\Omega r \sin\theta'\sin\Theta\,
           \hat \epsilon_\perp \, .
\end{equation}

